wait 0.6
press use
await talking 3
wait 0.4
press use
await beat:teague_sold 3
wait 0.4
shot 20-solis-says-whose-roads with talking,beat:teague_sold
press use
wait 0.6

# --- 9 BACK AT THE CAMP: the next morning, the old soldier, with what the archive showed him --
hour 9 +1
wait 1.0
tap inventory
wait 0.5
