press map 0.2
await app:map 6
wait 0.6
shot 22-the-survey-pins-the-narrows with app:map,goal:camp_back
press map 0.2
await app:none 5
at mark:the_raft
wait 0.8
tap ride
await riding:raft 3
walkto at:slot:the_crossing 240
wait 0.3
walkto at:slot:the_camp 20 till:step_off_ready
tap ride
